00:39:27.140 --> 00:39:31.400
But now it becomes like
became 0.4, 0.4, 0.2.

00:39:31.400 --> 00:39:33.380
This is not OK.

00:39:33.380 --> 00:39:34.160
We will just say--

00:39:36.680 --> 00:39:38.710
OK, so don't worry
